{"term":"greasy","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:0e550bd32c0ec6150c","definition":"Having a slippery surface; having a surface covered with grease.","example":"a greasy mineral","pos":"adj","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greasy#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:dbb42180d0c629382b","definition":"Containing a lot of grease or fat.","example":"c. 1795, Margaret Taylor, Mrs. Taylor’s Family Companion: or The Whole Art of Cookery Display’d, London: W. Lane, “To fry flat Fish,” p. 37,\nBefore you dish them up, lay them upon a drainer before the fire sloping, for two or three minutes, which will prevent their eating greasy.","pos":"adj","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greasy#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:d4526abb3c289e0365","definition":"Oily in manner; obsequious.","example":"He does not impress me favourably. He is glib, ingratiating, and distinctly 'greasy.' He has a ready answer for everything almost before the question is out of your mouth.","pos":"adj","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greasy#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:93ca1d6022a6276809","definition":"Shady, sketchy, dodgy, detestable, unethical.","example":"Julian: We're gonna fill the trailers up with furniture all right, boys, but we're gonna rent them out by the hour.\n Bubbles: Aw, that's greasy.","pos":"adj","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"slang","register":"slang","wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greasy#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:3cbf8ab2f7f3b8b6aa","definition":"Fat, bulky.","example":"Let’s consult together against this greasy knight.","pos":"adj","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"obsolete","register":"obsolete","wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greasy#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:eb436f0f0b0fd34ca6","definition":"Gross; indelicate; indecent.","example":"Now I am perfect hate, I lou’d but three things in the world, Philosophy, Thrift, and my self. Thou hast made me hate Philosophy. A Vsurers greasie Codpeece made me loath Thrift: but if all the Brewers Iades in the town can drug me from loue of my selfe, they shall doo more then e’re the seuen wise men of Greece could […]","pos":"adj","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"obsolete","register":"obsolete","wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greasy#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:cb17bc0d47ab5acdfe","definition":"Afflicted with the disease called grease.","example":"","pos":"adj","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"","wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greasy#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:b8c4c6b17f27e3dc29","definition":"An annoyed or contemptuous look; a dirty look.","example":"At the end of the day, when my baby is hungry, you’re going to see a boob. It’s natural, it’s beautiful, and it’s something that should be celebrated. Shout out to the dude who gave me a greasy at my local cafe last week. This one is for you.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"Australia","register":"Australia, countable","wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greasy#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:199eb0cd3d3dda94be","definition":"Wool that still contains grease and has not undergone scouring.","example":"Competition for South African wools has been very unsatisfactory, heavy conditioned greasies being at times practically unsalable.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":["scoured"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"countable, uncountable","wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/greasy#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"ipa":"/ˈɡɹi.si/","us":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3e/En-au-greasy.ogg/En-au-greasy.ogg.mp3"},"wordFamily":["greasily","greasiness","greasy kid's stuff","greasy pole","greasy spoon","nongreasy","overgreasy","ungreasy"]}